[[2047,127,65536,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Release the seat belt from the trim.</p><p>2. Unscrew the bolts.</p><p>3. Remove the trim.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019436.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,65536,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the trim is not damaged.</p><p>Position the trim and fix it with the bolts.</p><p>Engage the seat belt on the trim.</p>"]]